{"description": "Glazed meat piece at upper right: brown, shiny sticky glaze with char marks, shredded/sliced chunk about 8 cm long, moist with darker edges, garnished with green scallion-like bits; covers roughly 10% of plate, moderate thickness.", "candidates": ["teriyaki glazed chicken thigh", "glazed pork belly", "barbecue glazed salmon"], "grams": 110},
{"description": "Yellow-orange baked or roasted chunk at left: golden-orange flesh with lightly browned edges and a dark green skin or herb piece on one side, moist, dense, roughly 5 cm across, covers about 4% of plate.", "candidates": ["roasted sweet potato", "baked butternut squash", "fried plantain"], "grams": 60},
{"description": "Loose yellow grains in center-left: bright yellow, separate fluffy grains with some clumps, dry-looking with slight sheen, spread about 7 cm by 6 cm, thin layer.", "candidates": ["turmeric saffron rice", "yellow rice pilaf", "buttered yellow couscous"], "grams": 85},
{"description": "Wilted leafy greens at bottom: dark green, glossy, limp folded leaves with some pale pieces, slightly wet sheen, covering about 20% of plate, thin layer.", "candidates": ["sautéed kale", "steamed collard greens", "wilted spinach with oil"], "grams": 70},
{"description": "Pale light green leafy pieces and a pale slice in the middle-right: crisp-looking light lettuce-like pieces with translucent edges, some soft and wilted, small pale orange bit, covering about 8% of plate.", "candidates": ["iceberg lettuce salad", "cabbage slaw", "cooked napa cabbage"], "grams": 40},
{"description": "Small amount of sauce or glaze residue on the plate near the meat and greens: thin brownish sheen, not pooled, very little volume.", "candidates": ["teriyaki sauce", "soy-based glaze", "vinaigrette dressing"], "grams": 10}
]}
